# Local-only: absolute path to a directory OUTSIDE the repo holding private
# preset bundles. When set, `pnpm dev` serves its files (allow-listed
# extensions only) at /api/private-presets/<relative-path>. Leave unset in
# production; the route then always answers 404.
# POSTEXT_PRIVATE_PRESETS_DIR=/absolute/path/to/private-presets

# Base URL of the `postext-media` Worker that streams the home-page showreel
# (HLS from Cloudflare R2). Unset → the showreel section is not rendered.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MEDIA_BASE=https://postext-media.<account>.workers.dev
